: "'alayhim", "root": "علي"}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 1, "ayah": 7, "text": "غَيْرِ اِ۬لْمَغْضُوبِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا اَ۬لضَّآلِّينَۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "غَيْرِ", "translit": "ghayri", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "اِ۬لْمَغْضُوبِ", "translit": "al-maghdubi", "root": "غضب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translit": "'alayhim", "root": "علي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "wa-la", "root": "لا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "اَ۬لضَّآلِّينَۖ", "translit": "ad-dallin", "root": "ضلل"}], "narration": "warsh"}]}